7. VIRTUAL KNOWLEDGE DRIVE
==================================================

GammaThink exposes local and remote knowledge
archives through one logical storage interface.

                  VIRTUAL KNOWLEDGE DRIVE
                             |
             +---------------+---------------+
             |               |               |
             v               v               v
         LOCAL SSD       IPFS MOUNT       REMOTE API
             |               |               |
             v               v               v
         ZIM / GKS       REMOTE GKS       QUERY SERVICE
             |               |               |
             +---------------+---------------+
                             |
                             v
                     UNIFIED CoK VIEW

BACKENDS:

- LocalStorageBackend
- IPFSStorageBackend
- RemoteQueryBackend
- LocalJournalBackend

MOUNT OPERATIONS:

- Mount archive
- Unmount archive
- Resolve logical archive name
- Resolve knowledge object ID
- Retrieve archive metadata
- Read indexed object chunks
- Prefetch dependencies
- Cache retrieved blocks

Remote archives appear as logical mounts.

IPFS mounts are read-only.

New derivations are written to a local
writable journal overlay.

Unmounting an archive marks unavailable
dependencies without declaring them false.


