- Content-addressed
- Modular
- Hot-swappable
- Cross-archive references
- Integrity verification
- Partial retrieval support

SNAPSHOT STRUCTURE:

                  GKS SNAPSHOT ROOT
                         |
                         v
                    ROOT MANIFEST
                         |
          +--------------+--------------+
          |              |              |
          v              v              v
