          |              |              |
          v              v              v
       Version         Object IDs      Claims
       Schema          Concepts        Rules
       Dependencies    Relationships   Derivations
       Signatures      Conclusions     Evidence

Objects should be grouped into independently
retrievable chunks.

The snapshot format must support both
local SSD access and IPFS block retrieval.

A single monolithic compressed archive
must not be required for small remote queries.


